Subject: [PATCH] Compile MilkDrop's legacy equation form in every code phase

Local fix against projectM 4.1.7 plus patches 0001–0029. Patch 0029 retried only
per-frame code in MilkDrop's legacy form. Move that retry into one helper
(LegacyEquationCode) and use it for preset init, per-frame and per-pixel code,
custom wave init, per-frame and per-point code, and custom shape init and
per-frame code. Code the evaluator accepts still compiles unchanged; rejected code
is retried once as MilkDrop's CState::StripLinefeedCharsAndComments (record
separators, including CR, and // or \\ line comments removed) followed by NS-EEL
preprocessCode's rule that a ';' inside parentheses without a following operand is
a space. Compile errors now carry the evaluator's message with the original
line (record number) and column. Tests cover each phase, disabled components,
both comment forms, CR/LF, empty records, accepted programs and invalid code.
---
